{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "City selection profiles. A seed names at most one with `profile`; a seed without it is `standard`. Read by profile.mjs (selection, preflight, source scene, acceptance, receipts) and by metadata.py (which place tags may name the city node). The documented empty slot is a feature of the profile, never of a single run: a slot without an honest source keeps the game's own fictional venue, and the selection records why. `outpost` (a research station or a settlement of a few houses) and `wilderness` (a place with no settlement: a glacier, a reef) are for the uninhabited and station-only entries (OUTPOST-PLAN 13 Oct 2026): they may name a mapped `gateway` instead of an airport, need authored `links` (travel is authored-only), take the profile-only `extraction` filters of offline-extract.py, and never select, label or draw military or aviation features.",
